  vendorName: Auctioneer Higgins
  offerText: That sprawling, oversized billiards table is completely unnecessary.
    Let my team take it to the elite auction house tonight. I will front you the
    cash right now.
  acceptResultText: The heavy table is disassembled and removed. The cash in your
    hand is nice, but losing your favorite pastime leaves you deeply bored and unhappy.
  rejectResultText: You keep the table. It takes up way too much room, but you refuse
    to let high-society snobs take your game.
  acceptedDelayedText: The auction was a bust, and Higgins legally holds you liable
    for the 'transport and failure fees'. The stress of the massive debt gives you
    a severe panic attack.
  rejectedDelayedText: 
